prime-agent-ai

AI provider abstraction layer for Prime Agent. Wraps Anthropic,
Google, Mistral, OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, and other LLM provider
APIs behind a unified interface with caching, diagnostics, and
type-safe schemas.

This is a sub-package of the Prime Agent monorepo, distributed as
a pre-built npm package. The dist/ directory contains compiled
TypeScript output (JavaScript + type declarations).

Includes the pi-ai CLI binary for interactive AI usage.
